Dear Students, 👋

1️⃣ You can  Now backdate MI meetings conducted in August &amp; September. 

2️⃣ Backdating is NOT possible on the Konnect app 📱❌ — it works only on the Konnect website 🖥️✅

3️⃣ Steps to follow on the website: schedule your MI meeting ➡️ submit your feedback form ➡️ get mentor approval 👍 Rest MI rules stay the same of 48 hours. 

🔻 So once Scheduled backdated - your window period of submitting the Feedback form and Getting it approved will not have much time. So do it immediately.

4️⃣ Deadline: 28th September 🗓️⏰

5️⃣ After 28th September, you will NOT be able to schedule any backdated MI meetings ⚠️

❗Please complete this on priority and get your approvals from mentors soon. 

All the best! 🌟@⁨all⁩‬" data-testid="last-msg-status"><span>You reacted <img crossorigin="anonymous" alt="❤️" draggable="false" class="x1k0y4fr b7 emoji wa  xnpuxes" tabindex="-1" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" style="background-position: -80px -80px;"> to:</span><span>&nbsp;</span>"<span dir="ltr" class="x1iyjqo2 x6ikm8r x10wlt62 x1n2onr6 xlyipyv xuxw1ft x1rg5ohu xnpuxes" style="min-height: 0px;"><img crossorigin="anonymous" alt="📢" draggable="false" class="b74 emoji wa  xnpuxes" tabindex="-1" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" style="background-position: -80px -40px;"> Schedule Update – Backdated MI Meetings&nbsp;

