<img crossorigin="anonymous" alt="3️⃣" draggable="false" class="b0 emoji wa  xnpuxes" tabindex="-1" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" style="background-position: 0px -20px;"> Steps to follow on the website: schedule your MI meeting <img crossorigin="anonymous" alt="➡️" draggable="false" class="b8 emoji wa  xnpuxes" tabindex="-1" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" style="background-position: 0px -20px;"> submit your feedback form <img crossorigin="anonymous" alt="➡️" draggable="false" class="b8 emoji wa  xnpuxes" tabindex="-1" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" style="background-position: 0px -20px;"> get mentor approval <img crossorigin="anonymous" alt="👍" draggable="false" class="b38 emoji wa  xnpuxes" tabindex="-1" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" style="background-position: 0px -40px;"> Rest MI rules stay the same of 48 hours.&nbsp;

<img crossorigin="anonymous" alt="🔻" draggable="false" class="b78 emoji wa  xnpuxes" tabindex="-1" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" style="background-position: -40px 0px;"> So once Scheduled backdated - your window period of submitting the Feedback form and Getting it approved will not have much time. So do it immediately.

<img crossorigin="anonymous" alt="4️⃣" draggable="false" class="b0 emoji wa  xnpuxes" tabindex="-1" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" style="background-position: -20px -20px;"> Deadline: 28th September <img crossorigin="anonymous" alt="🗓️" draggable="false" class="b82 emoji wa  xnpuxes" tabindex="-1" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" style="background-position: 0px 0px;"><img crossorigin="anonymous" alt="⏰" draggable="false" class="b1 emoji wa  xnpuxes" tabindex="-1" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" style="background-position: -40px -40px;">

<img crossorigin="anonymous" alt="5️⃣" draggable="false" class="b0 emoji wa  xnpuxes" tabindex="-1" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" style="background-position: -40px -20px;"> After 28th September, you will NOT be able to schedule any backdated MI meetings <img crossorigin="anonymous" alt="⚠️" draggable="false" class="b4 emoji wa  xnpuxes" tabindex="-1" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" style="background-position: -20px -40px;">

<img crossorigin="anonymous" alt="❗" draggable="false" class="b7 emoji wa  xnpuxes" tabindex="-1" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" style="background-position: -40px -80px;">Please complete this on priority and get your approvals from mentors soon.&nbsp;

